# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. The vowel is
# set up before the recording (its moves at a hand's pace take ~15 s); the clip starts on it.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tap HOME
turn K3 -7 80
turn K2 55 80
turn K4 55 80
tapkey b2
tapkey b7
tap HOME
turn K3 16 80
turn K2 -18 80
turn K4 3 80
tap EDIT
turn K3 34 80
tap LFO
turn K2 -85 80
wait 1000
shot talk-0.png
wav talk.wav
# @ both drones on D3, saws, band-pass: drone I on the first formant, drone II on the second, a dark "oo"
wait 2500
# @ LFO I swings drone II's filter (key 8 twice, send -35): the drones talk, "ooo-eee", every 6 or 7 seconds
tapkey b7
tapkey b7
turn K4 50 40
turn SELECT 20 60
wait 500
shot talk-1.png
wait 18000
wavstop
